,"speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3688619482,"text":"Who, me?","nextNodeIds":[733500406]},{"nodeId":733500406,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2728079106,"text":"I'd like your help with taking a picture, just one. It won't take long.","nextNodeIds":[733500409]},{"nodeId":733500409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2119920354,"text":"*sigh* It's embarrassing to admit, but the aroma of the spices here is a little too strong for me...","nextNodeIds":[733500410]},{"nodeId":733500410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":663119770,"text":"During my time in Fontaine, I never had food with even just a hint of spiciness, a pinch of salt is as much as I can take.","nextNodeIds":[733500411]},{"nodeId":733500411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":3270811202,"text":"Here, I'm sneezing so much that— ACHOO! I can't even hold the Kamera steadily...","nextNodeIds":[733500412]},{"nodeId":733500412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1832377346,"text":"So, all I can do... is ask someone else to take a photo for me.","nextNodeIds":[733500413]},{"nodeId":733500413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1883959818,"text":"You certainly seem to be a kind person, so... I'd like to ask for your help.","nextNodeIds":[733500414]},{"nodeId":733500414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1871566258,"text":"You're from Fontaine?","nextNodeIds":[733500415]},{"nodeId":733500415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2170784706,"text":"Indeed. I'm very sorry that I forgot to introduce myself...","nextNodeIds":[733500416]},{"nodeId":733500416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1697230306,"text":"I'm Augustus Lovelace, a researcher from Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering.","nextNodeIds":[733500417,733500418]},{"nodeId":733500417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4259735554,"text":"Fontaine Research Institute of Kinetic Energy Engineering?","nextNodeIds":[733500419]},{"nodeId":733500419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2601353778,"text":"It's a mouthful, isn't it? You can call it the Fontaine Research Institute, as most people in Fontaine do.","nextNodeIds":[733500420]},{"nodeId":733500420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2790538986,"text":"The Fontaine Research Institute used to be a paradise for researchers in Fontaine and where most mechanical creations originated.","nextNodeIds":[733500421]},{"nodeId":733500421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":3796585778,"text":"But thanks to Mr. Edwin, most buildings in the Fontaine Research Institute are lying in ruin now...","nextNodeIds":[733500422]},{"nodeId":733500422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2717626818,"text":"And ever since Raimondo and Mr. Choiseul took over the reconstruction project, the spirit of research at the institute has been in freefall.","nextNodeIds":[733500423]},{"nodeId":733500423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2062359954,"text":"I have standards and prefer a tidy environment. I refuse to live in a pile of rubble, and so I've been traveling around.","nextNodeIds":[733500424]},{"nodeId":733500424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2990127970,"text":"Don't let my troubles spoil your mood, they have nothing to do with you.","nextNodeIds":[733500425]},{"nodeId":733500425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1627724578,"text":"Come on, please hurry and snap a photo for me. Once Xavier sees the beauty of Sumeru, there's no way he'll stay in Inazuma!","nextNodeIds":[733500426,733500436]},{"nodeId":733500426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1563606258,"text":"I've worked with Xavier...","nextNodeIds":[733500427]},{"nodeId":733500427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2055906730,"text":"You... Whoa! Are you the Traveler that Xavier told me about?","nextNodeIds":[733500428]},{"nodeId":733500428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1367547386,"text":"A pleasure! It's truly an honor to meet you! I've read all about your heroic feats in the Mikage Furnace from Xavier's letters.","nextNodeIds":[733500429]},{"nodeId":733500429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":246091770,"text":"And whenever Xavier talks about films in his letters, he always mentions your extraordinary acting skills!","nextNodeIds":[733500430]},{"nodeId":733500430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":3186790298,"text":"He says you're fearless, noble, and most importantly, you have a great sense of humor!","nextNodeIds":[733500431]},{"nodeId":733500431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":542519282,"text":"Oh, once you've taken the photo, you must give me your autograph. It would be perfect if you signed the photo!","nextNodeIds":[733500432]},{"nodeId":733500432,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":721749346,"text":"How is Xavier doing these days?","nextNodeIds":[733500433]},{"nodeId":733500433,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":4262756042,"text":"Well, to be honest... not great. He's anxious about his film, and based on his letters, he has been having trouble finding an interesting new subject lately.","nextNodeIds":[733500434]},{"nodeId":733500434,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":3385997194,"text":"I suggested that he should do as I did and take some time off in Sumeru.","nextNodeIds":[733500435]},{"nodeId":733500435,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":4113773074,"text":"But he keeps insisting that he must shoot the best possible film for the Yashiro Commission, and he refuses to leave Inazuma until it's done.","nextNodeIds":[733500441]},{"nodeId":733500441,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":455708066,"text":"That's enough of that. Come and take a photo of me. Right here will do.","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":733500436,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":4183046402,"text":"How did you get to know Xavier?","nextNodeIds":[733500437]},{"nodeId":733500437,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2424127234,"text":"As you must be well aware, Xavier is a researcher from the Fontaine Research Institute. We used to work in the same laboratory, and he once gave me quite a bit of help.","nextNodeIds":[733500438]},{"nodeId":733500438,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":2351847722,"text":"He insisted on shooting a film and being the director. That wasn't a very popular idea in Fontaine Research Institute at the time.","nextNodeIds":[733500439]},{"nodeId":733500439,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":1602342946,"text":"Even after being assigned to other projects, he still continued shooting \"dokumentari films\" in the name of recording their research process.","nextNodeIds":[733500442]},{"nodeId":733500442,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":3653771026,"text":"Just like that, he went back and forth between projects and the laboratory until he was finally sent to Inazuma...","nextNodeIds":[733500440]},{"nodeId":733500440,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4456,"speakerName":"Augustus Lovelace","textMapHash":562529666,"text":"He's a very resourceful person. I'm certain that had he been born in the past, when funding was abundant and more fields of research were accepted, or been born in a brighter future, he would have accomplished great things...","nextNodeIds":[733500441]},{"nodeId":733500418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3035944074,"text":"What kind of place is that?","nextNodeIds":[733500419]},{"nodeId":733500405,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1224060322,"text":"What can I do for you?","nextNodeIds":[733500406]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7335001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7335005,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4456"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":7335002,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Tak